#ASSERT `May I make a family provision claim` `as the claimant` `a child of the deceased's spouse or de facto partner, not the deceased's child` `before the deceased died` TRUE FALSE FALSE TRUE FALSE 0 TRUE FALSE FALSE (Date 1 6 2020) 500000 EQUALS `my standing is` `standing: yes`
#ASSERT `May I make a family provision claim` `as the claimant` `a child of the deceased's spouse or de facto partner, not the deceased's child` `before the deceased died` TRUE FALSE FALSE TRUE FALSE 0 TRUE FALSE FALSE (Date 1 6 2010) 500000 EQUALS `my standing is` `no: a stepchild may apply only if the deceased died on or after 16 January 2013 (s 7(2A))`
#ASSERT `May I make a family provision claim` `as the claimant` `a child of the deceased's spouse or de facto partner, not the deceased's child` `before the deceased died` FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE TRUE 900000 TRUE FALSE FALSE (Date 1 6 2020) 500000 EQUALS `my standing is` `standing: yes`
