#ASSERT `Can the will or the intestacy shut me out` `as the claimant` TRUE FALSE EQUALS `yes if` (`Can the will or the intestacy shut out my claim` TRUE FALSE)
-- s 7(2), (3), k084: filed 1 March 2053: in time; 15 April 2053: out of time unless leave; with leave: heard.
#ASSERT `Will my claim be heard, or is it out of time` `as the claimant` TRUE `the 14 October 2052 grant` (Date 1 3 2053) FALSE EQUALS `my application is` `timing: in time`
#ASSERT `Will my claim be heard, or is it out of time` `as the claimant` TRUE `the 14 October 2052 grant` (Date 15 4 2053) FALSE EQUALS `my application is` `timing: out of time`
#ASSERT `Will my claim be heard, or is it out of time` `as the claimant` TRUE `the 14 October 2052 grant` (Date 15 4 2053) TRUE EQUALS `my application is` `out of time, but it will be heard: the Court has given leave to file out of time (s 7(2)(b))`
#ASSERT `Will my claim be heard, or is it out of time` `as the claimant` TRUE `the 14 October 2052 grant` (Date 15 4 2053) FALSE EQUALS `my application is` (`Is my application in time` `the 14 October 2052 grant` (Date 15 4 2053) FALSE)
-- s 6(1), (3): in time, the Court of the opinion: it may order; not of that opinion: no order; no application: none;
-- not a person who may apply: none.
#ASSERT `Can the Court order provision out of the estate for me` `as the claimant` `standing: yes` TRUE `timing: in time` TRUE FALSE EQUALS `the Court's power` `the Court may order such provision for me as it thinks fit, as a lump sum or a periodical or other payment, with conditions (s 6(1), (3), (4))`
#ASSERT `Can the Court order provision out of the estate for me` `as the claimant` `standing: yes` TRUE `timing: in time` FALSE FALSE EQUALS `the Court's power` `no order: the Court is not of the opinion that adequate provision was not made for my proper maintenance, support, education or advancement in life (s 6(1))`
#ASSERT `Can the Court order provision out of the estate for me` `as the claimant` `standing: yes` FALSE `timing: in time` TRUE FALSE EQUALS `the Court's power` `no order: no application has been made by me or on my behalf (s 6(1))`
#ASSERT `Can the Court order provision out of the estate for me` `as the claimant` `standing: no class` TRUE `timing: in time` TRUE FALSE EQUALS `the Court's power` `no order: I am not a person who may apply (s 7(1))`
#ASSERT `Can the Court order provision out of the estate for me` `as the claimant` `standing: yes` TRUE `timing: out of time` TRUE FALSE EQUALS `the Court's power` `no order: my application will not be heard, being out of time without leave (s 7(2))`
#ASSERT `Can the Court order provision out of the estate for me` `as the claimant` `standing: yes` TRUE `timing: in time` TRUE TRUE EQUALS `the Court's power` (`Can the Court order provision for me` `standing: yes` TRUE `timing: in time` TRUE TRUE)
